{'html': ''} [{"title": "Overview Tab | CSSD-F4000GBMP600PLPW", "type": "overview", "visible": true, "content": [{"title": "CSSD-F4000GBMP600PLPW - HTML Markuptext-field-black-color-v2", "markup": "<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1/akamai/corsair-pwa/css/pdp.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1/akamai/corsair-pwa/pdp/mp600-pro-lpx/assets/mp600-pro-lpx-styles.min.css"><div id="pdp" class="mp600-pro-lpx-wht"> <section id="panel-hero" class="panel-template product-hero" style="background:#000 url('//assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/pdp/mp600/images/mp600_hero.jpg') center no-repeat; background-size:cover;"> <video autoplay preload loop muted poster="//assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/pdp/mp600/images/mp600_hero.jpg" id="videoHero"> <source src="https://assets.corsair.com/video/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/responsive/videos/MP600_Loop_v01.mp4"> </video> <div class="hero-content-container"> <div class="wrapper text-center white" style="position:relative; z-index:1"> <h2 class="style-h1">MP600 PRO LPX</h2> <p class="yellow-subtext">M.2 PCIe Gen4 SSD - PS5 Compatible</p> <div class="verveine white">STEP UP YOUR PS5 STORAGE</div> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiB__6Ex_xI" class="cta-yellow popup-youtube">WATCH VIDEO</a> </div> </div> </section> <section id="fit" class="panel-template"> <div class="overlay white show-on-mobile"></div> <div class="wrapper"> <div class="col-half top"> <h2>A PERFECT FIT FOR YOUR&nbsp;PS5</h2> <p>With a compact M.2 2280 form-factor, the MP600 PRO LPX White easily fits directly into your console and exceeds all PS5/PS5 PRO M.2 performance requirements for a quick and easy upgrade.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section id="boost" class="panel-template"> <div class="overlay white show-on-mobile"></div> <div class="wrapper"> <div class="col-half offset-half"> <h2>BOOST YOUR GAME&nbsp;COLLECTION</h2> <p>Expand your console's storage up to a massive 4TB, fitting the needs of nearly any game library, whether you have four games, 40, or more.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section id="faster" class="panel-template"> <div class="overlay white show-on-mobile"></div> <div class="wrapper"> <div class="col-half"> <h2>GAMING MADE FASTER</h2> <p>Achieve lightning-fast speeds up to 7,100MB/sec sequential read and 6,800MB/sec sequential write with PCIe Gen4 technology, allowing large game files to load faster and smoother.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section id="throttle" class="panel-template fivepadding"> <div class="wrapper"> <div class="col-half text-center bottom"> <img loading="lazy" src="//assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/pdp/mp600-pro-lpx/assets/images/mp600prolpx_wht_throttle.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Low-profile heatsink optimized for PS5 storage."> </div> <div class="col-half top"> <h2>KEEP THROTTLING AT&nbsp;BAY</h2> <p>Features a pre-installed low-profile aluminum heat spreader that helps disperse heat and reduce throttling, so your SSD maintains sustained high performance no matter your game intensity. </p> </div> </div> </section> <section id="last" class="panel-template"> <div class="overlay white show-on-mobile"></div> <div class="wrapper"> <div class="col-half"> <h2>Made To Last</h2> <p>Built with high-density 3D TLC NAND to provide the ideal mix of performance and endurance needed to keep your drive performing at its best for years.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class="panel-template fivepadding" style="background:#111 url('//assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/img/reusable/pdp-blk-bkg-right-triangle.png') bottom right repeat-y; background-size:100%; background-attachment:fixed;"> <div class="wrapper text-center"> <div class="text-center white col-half"> <img loading="lazy" src="//assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/akamai/pdp/mp600/images/warranty_badge_5yrs.png" class="img-responsive" style="margin-bottom: 20px;" alt="CORSAIR 5-year warranty badge"> <h2>GAME WITH CERTAINTY</h2> <p>Comprehensive 5-year warranty backed by long-term reliability and industry-leading customer support for extended peace of mind.</p> </div> </div> </section></div>", "linkedScript": [{"templateName": "LINKED JS CSS | CA-9011286 | productDetails", "linkedJs": ["https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106161/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/jquery-1_11_3_min.js", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106159/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/hammer-v2_0_8-min.js", "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/chosen/1.8.7/chosen.jquery.min.js", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106160/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/index-1-min.js", "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/magnific-popup.js/1.1.0/jquery.magnific-popup.min.js", "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.min.js", "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/2.1.3/TweenMax.min.js", "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.min.js", "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/ScrollMagic/2.0.8/ScrollMagic.min.js", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106160/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/hybris-animation.gsap.min.js", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106528/cwsmgmt/js/minified/pdp-v56-min.js"], "linkedCss": ["https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783106158/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/allCssAlphaFix.css", "https://assets.ctfassets.net/87bewhkgljl1/4wINsHOKU2xeZzDws62XNi/c5b8c1bd34ef9aaf0ccd19cc85d01f02/overWriteAllCssAlpha.css", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1723841200/contentful-files/override_all_css_alpha.css", "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css", "https://assets.corsair.com/raw/upload/v1783113567/cwsmgmt/contentful-migrated-files/addons_responsive.css", "https://assets.ctfassets.net/87bewhkgljl1/twmr4rC9CQwMzQrDBrhhD/86aec7d352895fe6651366302ef52a7b/