 <div class="wrapper text-center white" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
 <h2 class="style-h1 text-shadow">MP700</h2>
 <p class="yellow-subtext text-shadow">GEN5 PCI<span class="lowercase">e x</span>4 M.2 NVM<span class="lowercase">e</span> SSD</p>
 <div class="white verveine text-shadow">BLAZING FAST GEN5 SPEEDS</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>


 <section id="extreme-gen5" class="panel-template fivepadding">
 <div class="wrapper">
 <div class="col-half white">
 <h2>XTREME GEN5 STORAGE PERFORMANCE</h2>
 <p>PCIe Gen5 x4 combines with the massively high-bandwidth NVMe 2.0 interface to unleash higher-speed data transfers and greater M.2 SSD performance than ever before.</p>
 <span class="sub-spec">UP TO</span>
 <h2 class="no-wrap">10,000MB/<span class="lowercase">sec</span> <span style="font-size: 1.75rem;">Sequential&nbsp;Read</span></h2>
 <span class="sub-spec">UP TO</span>
 <h2 class="no-wrap">10,000MB/<span class="lowercase">sec</span> <span style="font-size: 1.75rem;">Sequential&nbsp;Write</span> </h2>
 <p style="opacity: .7;font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.25rem;">*SSD cooling required. Check your motherboard for details.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <img id="extreme-img" src="https://assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/akamai/pdp/ssd/mp700-v2/assets/images/mp700-panel01-img.webp" class="img-absolute half stack-on-mobile centered" />
 </section>
 <section id="high-density" class="panel-template fivepadding">
 <div class="wrapper">
 <div class="col-half offset-half white">
 <h2>HIGH-DENSITY 3D TLC NAND</h2>
 <p>Combines high-speed performance with outstanding endurance, ensuring your drive will last and perform well through many years of use.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <img id="density-img" src="https://assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/products/Storage/CSSD-F1000GBMP700/Content/mp700-panel02-img.webp" class="img-absolute half stack-on-mobile centered" />
 </section>
 <section id="extreme-gen5" class="panel-template fivepadding">
 <div class="wrapper">
 <div class="col-half white">
 <h2>Compact M.2 2280 Form-Factor</h2>
 <p>Fits directly onto most motherboards.*</p>
 <p style="opacity: .7;font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.25rem;">*Select Intel Z690 and Z790 and AMD 600 Series motherboards; lower performance on PCIe Gen4 M.2 motherboards</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <img id="compact-img" src="https://assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/akamai/pdp/ssd/mp700-v2/assets/images/mp700-panel03-img.webp" class="img-absolute half stack-on-mobile centered" />
 </section>
 <section id="extreme-gen5" class="panel-template fivepadding">
 <div class="wrapper">
 <div class="col-half white">
 <h2>Microsoft DirectStorage**</h2>
 <p>Enables the MP700 to communicate directly with your graphics card when playing compatible games, for unbelievably fast load times.</p>
 <p style="opacity: .7;font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.25rem;">**DirectStorage requires a DirectX12 GPU with Shader Model 6.0 support</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 <img id="microsoft-img" src="https://assets.corsair.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/akamai/pdp/ssd/mp700-v2/assets/images/mp700-panel05-infographic.webp" class="img-absolute half stack-on-mobile centered" />
